# Loose layout sheets never go in here.
# Three of them were sitting in this folder untracked on 2026-08-23, and this
# repository is public. See decision 0016 in the tool repository: a sheet is
# referenced by file name, never embedded.
sheets/

# Since 2026-08-25 three sheets ARE published, in assets/ with hashed names,
# and that is deliberate: the page ships with three tournament layouts, and a
# layout without its sheet is a field nobody can check against anything.
# Decision 0039 in the tool repository is the argument. They arrive through the
# bundler from src/assets/demo/, never by being dropped in here by hand.

# Captured layouts stay in the private tool repository.
*.layout.json
